{"id":"857c580ef52511af","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-fractional-derivative.md","title":"Fractional Derivative","display":"df-fractional-derivative — Fractional Derivative","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fractional-derivative","aliases":["58-df-fractional-derivative","Fractional Derivative","Riemann-Liouville"],"display":"df-fractional-derivative — Fractional Derivative","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fractional-derivative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fractional-derivative</span><span>Fractional Derivative</span><span>Riemann-Liouville</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fractional-derivative — Fractional Derivative"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"68427bc628af9b8d\" href=\"?note=68427bc628af9b8d\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md\">../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,f,g,a,b,\\alpha,n,Q\\in V\">\\(F,f,g,a,b,\\alpha,n,Q\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb R\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&lt;b\">\\(a&lt;b\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in\\mathcal L\">\\(I\\in\\mathcal L\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I\">\\(\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在本接口中是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,b]\">\\([a,b]\\)</span> 上的实值函数代表元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> 的扩展函数。只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 上具有下式给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 阶连续导数，不要求区间外可微。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\Gamma:\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\)</span> 由下式的正实参数 Euler 积分定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exp\">\\(\\exp\\)</span> 是标准实指数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)\\)</span> 由下式定义；导数塔的每一层均在同一开区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 上取值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;(x-\\delta,x+\\delta)\\subseteq U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,n+1,\\mathbb R^U)\\land Q(0)=g\\upharpoonright U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(|y-x|&lt;\\delta\\to|Q(j)(y)-Q(j)(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land x+h\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{Q(j)(x+h)-Q(j)(x)}h-Q(j+1)(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nn\\in\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;(x-\\delta,x+\\delta)\\subseteq U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,n+1,\\mathbb R^U)\\land Q(0)=g\\upharpoonright U\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(|y-x|&lt;\\delta\\to|Q(j)(y)-Q(j)(x)|&lt;\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon&gt;0\\;\\exists\\delta&gt;0\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n(0&lt;|h|&lt;\\delta\\land x+h\\in U)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{Q(j)(x+h)-Q(j)(x)}h-Q(j+1)(x)\\right|&lt;\\varepsilon\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\quad\n\\Gamma(s)=r\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\\bigl(r,\n\\{\\langle t,t^{s-1}\\exp(-t)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\},\n\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathcal L_{\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}},\\lambda_{\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\quad\n\\Gamma(s)=r\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\\bigl(r,\n\\{\\langle t,t^{s-1}\\exp(-t)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\},\n\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\mathcal L_{\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}},\\lambda_{\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a&lt;b\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n-1&lt;\\alpha&lt;n\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,[a,b],\\mathcal L_{[a,b]},\\lambda_{[a,b]})\n\\land\\exists Q\\;\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^{[a,t]}\\;\\Bigl[\nh(t)=0\\land\\forall s\\in[a,t)\\;h(s)=(t-s)^{n-\\alpha-1}f(s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(t),h,[a,t],\\mathcal L_{[a,t]},\\lambda_{[a,t]})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a&lt;b\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n-1&lt;\\alpha&lt;n\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,[a,b],\\mathcal L_{[a,b]},\\lambda_{[a,b]})\n\\land\\exists Q\\;\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^{[a,t]}\\;\\Bigl[\nh(t)=0\\land\\forall s\\in[a,t)\\;h(s)=(t-s)^{n-\\alpha-1}f(s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(t),h,[a,t],\\mathcal L_{[a,t]},\\lambda_{[a,t]})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a&lt;b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R}\\;\\exists Q\\;\\Bigl[\nn-1&lt;\\alpha&lt;n\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,(a,b),\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;F(t)=\\frac{Q(n)(t)}{\\Gamma(n-\\alpha)}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a&lt;b\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R}\\;\\exists Q\\;\\Bigl[\nn-1&lt;\\alpha&lt;n\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,(a,b),\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;F(t)=\\frac{Q(n)(t)}{\\Gamma(n-\\alpha)}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nD_{a+,[a,b]}^\\alpha f=F\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nD_{a+,[a,b]}^\\alpha f=F\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留原文件限定的非整数正阶、固定区间、逐点函数代表元以及局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^n\">\\(C^n\\)</span> 核积分函数；不改成 Caputo 导数、分布导数或几乎处处导数。</li>\n<li>核在单点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=t\">\\(s=t\\)</span> 取零只选择 Lebesgue 积分代表元；该点测度为零。导数塔避免将仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span> 上存在的一阶导数图误传给要求定义域为整个实轴的上游导数算子。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Podlubny, Fractional Differential Equations</li>\n<li>Kilbas and Trujilo, Differential Equations</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md","status":"resolved","id":"68427bc628af9b8d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-lebesgue.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$、$\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}$ 取 [[58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,f,g,a,b,\\alpha,n,Q\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"a<b","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\setminus\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LebesgueMeasure}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal L,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"I\\in\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_I=\\{A\\cap I:A\\in\\mathcal L\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_I=\\lambda\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_I","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"[a,b]","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R\\to\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathbb R_{>0}\\to\\mathbb R_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exp","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,U,n)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nn\\in\\omega\\land U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\delta>0\\;(x-\\delta,x+\\delta)\\subseteq U\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(Q,n+1,\\mathbb R^U)\\land Q(0)=g\\upharpoonright U\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon>0\\;\\exists\\delta>0\\;\\forall y\\in U\\;\n(|y-x|<\\delta\\to|Q(j)(y)-Q(j)(x)|<\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall j\\in n\\;\\forall x\\in U\\;\\forall\\varepsilon>0\\;\\exists\\delta>0\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl[\n(0<|h|<\\delta\\land x+h\\in U)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}\\to\\left|\\frac{Q(j)(x+h)-Q(j)(x)}h-Q(j+1)(x)\\right|<\\varepsilon\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\quad\n\\Gamma(s)=r\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\\bigl(r,\n\\{\\langle t,t^{s-1}\\exp(-t)\\rangle:t\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\},\n\\mathbb R_{>0},\\mathcal L_{\\mathbb R_{>0}},\\lambda_{\\mathbb R_{>0}}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a<b\\land\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\n\\land n\\in\\omega\\land n-1<\\alpha<n\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[a,b],\\mathbb R)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(r,f,[a,b],\\mathcal L_{[a,b]},\\lambda_{[a,b]})\n\\land\\exists Q\\;\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;\\exists h\\in\\mathbb R^{[a,t]}\\;\\Bigl[\nh(t)=0\\land\\forall s\\in[a,t)\\;h(s)=(t-s)^{n-\\alpha-1}f(s)\\\\\n&\\hspace{45mm}\\land\\mathrm{SignedIntegralValue}_S(g(t),h,[a,t],\\mathcal L_{[a,t]},\\lambda_{[a,t]})\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\alpha\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\setminus\\mathbb N\\land a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\land a<b\\\\\n&\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists g\\in\\mathbb R^{\\mathbb R}\\;\\exists Q\\;\\Bigl[\nn-1<\\alpha<n\n\\land\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleIntegralData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(g,f,a,b,\\alpha,n)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{RealDerivativeTower}_S(Q,g,(a,b),n)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,(a,b),\\mathbb R)\n\\land\\forall t\\in(a,b)\\;F(t)=\\frac{Q(n)(t)}{\\Gamma(n-\\alpha)}\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fractional\\text{-}derivative\\text{-}notation}\\vdash\nD_{a+,[a,b]}^\\alpha f=F\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RiemannLiouvilleDerivative}_S(F,f,a,b,\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"C^n","display":false},{"tex":"s=t","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false}],"bytes":4488,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-550","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-fractional-derivative.md|58-df-fractional-derivative]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","68427bc628af9b8d"]}